#: ../../source/templates_spacex.md:66
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_spacex.md:67
msgid ""
"**Universal uppercase**: Nearly every text element uses `text-transform: "
"uppercase`. This creates a systematic military/aerospace voice where all "
"communication feels like official documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_spacex.md:68
msgid ""
"**Positive letter-spacing as identity**: 0.96px on display, 1.17px on nav"
" — the wide tracking creates the stenciled, industrial feel that connects"
" to DIN's heritage as a German engineering standard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_spacex.md:69
msgid ""
"**Two weights, strict hierarchy**: D-DIN-Bold (700) for headlines and nav"
" emphasis, D-DIN (400) for body. No medium or semibold weights exist in "
"the system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_spacex.md:70
msgid ""
"**Tight line-heights**: 0.94–1.00 across most text — compressed, "
"efficient, mission-critical communication."
msgstr ""

